# This repository is a GitHub fork of itsmostafa/typesafe-mcp, and that fork
# relationship is deliberate: CONTRIBUTING.md asks for non-fork-specific changes
# to go upstream. But `gh stack` resolves the base repository to the fork PARENT
# and ignores every normal override: `gh repo set-default`, remote.origin.gh-resolved,
# explicit PR URLs, and `--remote origin`. Without GH_REPO it therefore operates on
# itsmostafa/typesafe-mcp, where our branches do not exist, which is what produced
# "No commits between main and ..." and "Head ref must be a branch" from gh stack submit.
#
# GH_REPO is the only override that works (verified against gh 2.101.0).
export GH_REPO=racecraft-lab/typesafe-mcp
